  "description": "What: a car bomb that does NOT stop (CE-4622 K-2/K-5/K-7; DESIGN_Checkpoint_And_Ramming CP-3, CP-5, RM-4): the squad 'Checkpoint' as in cp-routine-car; a 'VBIED' (Neutral car) with a Hostile 'Driver' and an 8 kg 'Car charge' in its boot rams at the checkpoint from x 60 at 16 m/s (RamTarget at the squad's place); the driver sets the charge off when a soldier is within 15 m (TriggerIed). Judge: (1) it is signalled, then judged a THREAT by time (it ignored the signal) (2) the ladder climbs \u2014 the Gunner's warning shot, disabling fire at the engine, lethal fire at the car \u2014 rungs skipped if short (3) the car is stopped short of the stand-off (disabled, coasting) OR reaches it and bursts. Fail: no threat, no fire, the car never hit, or the burst among the rear posts (x > 410)."
 },
